flowchart TB
  Source[(One local circuit document\nnodes + edges + frequencies + positions)]
  Source --> V1[Schematic 2D\neditable source view]
  Source --> V2[Topology Lens 3D\nrelationship reading]
  Source --> V3[Layer Stack\nmetal · Josephson · resonator · control]
  Source --> V4[Frequency Map\nnearest-neighbour spacing]
  Source --> V5[Crosstalk Risk Map\nadjacency + distance + detuning]
  Source --> V6[Optimizer Trace\nvisible proposals]
  Source --> V7[Exports\nJSON · OpenQASM · STL · STEP]
  Note[Every view derives from the same local model.\nNo projection becomes a physical simulation by itself.]
